WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.379 --> 00:00:07.390
There's more to Discovery's Naked and Afraid
than people running around in the buff, trying

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:09.460
to start fires by rubbing sticks together.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:14.070
A lot of planning goes into it…as well as
some dirty deeds behind the scenes.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:17.390
Here's the naked truth about Naked and Afraid.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:18.670
Truth or fiction?

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:22.650
Lo and behold, another reality show that's
received allegations of fakery.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:28.519
Controversial contestant Honora Bowen outed
Naked and Afraid in a blog post in late 2015.

00:00:28.519 --> 00:00:31.970
In her post, she recalls that producers made
sure they didn't miss out on exploiting her

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.320
father's death.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:37.680
In between frequent interviews about his passing,
she was also told by producers to refer to

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:41.640
a regular magnifying glass she’d brought
as “her father's magnifying glass.”

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.950
Her main complaints stem from the fact that
she was just trying to survive, while the

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:49.250
show was scripting her a fake story and coaching
her on how to act at the same time...which

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.560
can be pretty distracting.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.560
Doctors without lockers

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:57.510
In the same blog post, Honora Bowen also relates
that while out on a walk one day, she stumbled

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:59.329
upon the production company's medical tent.

00:00:59.329 --> 00:01:03.460
So of course, upon discovering it, she rummaged
through it and found some Emergen-C, which

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.469
she took and shared with contestants.

00:01:05.469 --> 00:01:08.020
And she's not the only one with sticky fingers.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:11.950
According to Bowen, during filming for Naked
and Afraid XL, fellow contestants stole food

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.189
from the medics.

00:01:13.189 --> 00:01:16.350
And for revealing this truth to the world,
Bowen received the honor of being threatened

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:17.350
with a lawsuit.

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:18.979
Ahh, show business…

00:01:18.979 --> 00:01:20.020
Real danger

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:24.649
Despite the allegations of artificiality against
the show, the people who appear on Naked and

00:01:24.649 --> 00:01:26.869
Afraid really do face actual dangers.

00:01:26.869 --> 00:01:29.990
But... some of the dangers get toned down
for TV.

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:33.439
During the very first episode, contestant
Shane Lewis broke three toes while filming

00:01:33.439 --> 00:01:35.369
in Costa Rica, according to the New York Post.

00:01:35.369 --> 00:01:39.990
However, when the episode aired in 2013, the
audience only learns that he injured his foot

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:40.990
somehow.

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:44.539
The severity of the injury isn't disclosed,
which is a strange choice given the nature

00:01:44.539 --> 00:01:45.539
of the show.

00:01:45.539 --> 00:01:49.149
“Because if I die, nobody gives a s--- about
me.”

00:01:49.149 --> 00:01:50.149
Poisoned Producer

00:01:50.149 --> 00:01:54.200
While Lewis' foot injury kind of got swept
under the rug, producers milked the injury

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.509
of one of their own for all its worth.

00:01:56.509 --> 00:02:00.459
During filming in Costa Rica, one of the producers
suffered a bite from a fer-de-lance, one of

00:02:00.459 --> 00:02:02.319
the deadliest pit vipers on the planet.

00:02:02.319 --> 00:02:08.819
“And as I jumped down I felt this bang hit
on the left foot.

00:02:08.819 --> 00:02:12.500
I knew straight away that it was a bite or
sting of some description.”

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:17.320
Quick and irritable, the fer-de-lance's venom
can cause bleeding of the gums and nose, gastrointestinal

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.520
bleeding, and vomiting, among a slew of other
unpleasant symptoms.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:24.950
In order to save the producer's foot, doctors
needed to hack off a five by twelve inch section

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:25.950
of his flesh.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:31.560
“I spent a month in hospital in total, I
had several surgical procedures removing dead

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:36.280
tissue having the skin graft and follow up
procedures on that.”

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.400
It's lucky that medical specialists were there.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:43.540
“Snakes, why did it have to be snakes.”

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:44.720
A little help

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:48.930
Broken toes and poisonous snakes aside, contestants
of Naked and Afraid don't truly have much

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.550
reason to be afraid.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:53.810
That's because they benefit from medical attention
behind the scenes as well.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:57.600
In the premiere episode, hungry and desperate
contestant Kim Shelton killed, cooked, and

00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:59.220
ate a poor, defenseless turtle.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:01.890
As a result, she became violently ill.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:05.080
Throughout the following three days, Shelton
was shown sleeping and suffering, yet on the

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.310
fourth day, she was feeling much better.

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:08.310
How?

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:11.900
Unbeknownst to viewers, medics nursed her
back to health with two IVs and some baby

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:12.900
food.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:16.710
Now, hopefully, no reality show will ever
allow any of its contestants die for the sake

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:17.710
of ratings.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:20.870
The producers of Naked and Afraid are smart
enough to have doctors on set.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:24.900
However, disguising the fact that medical
attention is given to cast and crew is still

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:28.840
dishonest, and potentially dangerous for anyone
who sees the show and thinks roasted beach

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.140
turtle is a good meal choice.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.140
No clothes?

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.250
No problem

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.590
The people who appear on Naked and Afraid
like hanging out in the buff for your viewing

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:37.590
pleasure.

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:38.980
“I like being naked.”

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.850
It's a good thing too, considering the nature
of the show.

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:46.210
During a panel at the TCA Summer TV Press
Tour, contestant Dani Julien said the naked

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:49.480
aspect of the show just "adds another element
to the survival challenge."

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.540
However, there was one gripe the survivalists
had with it.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.600
While contestants don't mind appearing in
their birthday suits, some of them wish the

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.910
pixelation was handled differently.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:01.670
Former contestant Justin Bullard said, "They
could have made my blur spot bigger."

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.330
Buck up, little guy!

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:07.140
But even though contestants are okay with
showing some skin, some viewers are downright

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.350
irate about it.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.569
One Million Moms

00:04:09.569 --> 00:04:14.520
The collective of eternally disapproving individuals
that is One Million Moms objects to the existence

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.910
of Naked and Afraid.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:19.730
But considering this group finds problems
with just about everything, that's not much

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.959
of a surprise.

00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:25.160
The ornery old ladies have blasted the show,
referring to it as "offensive," "inappropriate,"

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.380
and "soft porn," according to the Christian
Post.

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:30.850
As part of their crusade against bare bottoms,
they've taken to calling show sponsors and

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:33.480
asking them to stop buying ads during the
show.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:34.930
It seems to be working.

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:38.440
According to them, they managed to get both
Delta Faucet and Mars, Inc. to pull ads from

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:42.710
not just the show, but the network as a whole
during a 2016 marathon.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:47.710
Looks like One Million Moms actually accomplished
something, which is both surprising and frightening.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:48.720
Look out….

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.720
Kermit?

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.780
They’re coming for you next.

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.130
You can’t hack it

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:56.639
It stands to reason that not everyone who
survives Naked and Afraid would survive a

00:04:56.639 --> 00:04:59.440
similar-yet-actually-life-and-death situation.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.850
During a Reddit AMA, former season one contestant
Forrest Galante had some choice words about

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:06.030
co-contestant Cassie DePecol.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.970
According to him, DePecol only appeared on
the show with the hope that it would lead

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:13.090
to fame and fortune… since it worked so
well for Survivor’s Richard Hatch.

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:16.210
They should give Forrest a show called Naked
and Throwing Shade.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:17.530
Thanks for watching!

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:20.680
Subscribe to our YouTube channel to watch
more videos like the one you just saw.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:23.880
And leave us a comment to let us know what
you’ve heard about Naked and Afraid...

